<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-12">
      <h2>Getting Started</h2>
      <hr/>
      
      <div class="panel panel-default">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Step 1: Get a TKM Wallet</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>You need a TKM wallet address to receive mining payouts.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Use your exchange deposit address (Binance, KuCoin, etc.)</li>
            <li>Or download the official TKM wallet</li>
            <li>Or use a hardware wallet like Ledger/Trezor</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="panel panel-default">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Step 2: Download a RandomX Miner</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>We recommend XMRig for RandomX mining:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/xmrig/xmrig/releases" target="_blank">Download XMRig</a></li>
            <li>Choose your operating system (Windows, Linux, macOS)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="panel panel-default">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Step 3: Configure and Start Mining</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Run XMRig with the following command:</p>
          <pre>xmrig --url stratum+tcp://stratum.tkmchain.site:8008 --user YOUR_WALLET_ADDRESS --pass x --algo rx/0</pre>
          <p>For multiple rigs, add a worker name:</p>
          <pre>xmrig --url stratum+tcp://stratum.tkmchain.site:8008 --user YOUR_WALLET_ADDRESS.RIG1 --pass x --algo rx/0</pre>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="panel panel-default">
        <div class="panel-heading">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Step 4: Monitor Your Stats</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Enter your wallet address on the homepage to see:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Current hashrate</li>
            <li>Pending balance</li>
            <li>Payment history</li>
            <li>Worker statistics</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
